Z||000000||V8Fiero||05-14-2001||11:21 PM||||Well, I have updated my fiero again.<P>Just sold my 85 se 5spd 4cyl<BR>And in its place is an 86 auto V6<P>Car has been sitting for at least 2 yrs being started on and off to at least keep it running. Purrs pretty good I might add.<P>Has tan interior. Except for the drivers seat and the cracked corners on the dash its in pretty decent shape. Aux guages, Cruise, PW,PD, Rear defrost, rear speakers (never had those before  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> ) Needs some body work and ALOT of TLC.<P>First on the list is to change all the fluids.<P>Needs shocks all the way around. Front brakes.<P>I almost forgot how fun these V6's are to have. I know for sure now that it is time to get rid of the V8 project. I will fix this one up to drive daily. Working on getting a fast back to use only on special occasions.<P>Will post pics tomorrow. Too dark now.<P>P.S. Its gold with black trim.<P>Thanks for looking.<BR>Scott||||reg||14
